<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,412.71 points.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,412.71 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange finished officially at 7,412.71 points, up 142.77 points or 1.96 percent, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 5.669 billion forints, compared to 4.957 billion forints on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
